state S in nats, the GEP security decision function E(t) = σ(k(|S − S_baseline| − ε)) with A(t), β|∇S(t)| and ΔS, the
verdicts ALLOW / THROTTLE / STEP-UP / BLOCK / ISOLATE, the rule "credential validity does not override entropy
violation", the ~2-week online baseline and the key finding that attackers fail by being either overly regular or
randomly variant are the work of:

  Gary W. Floyd, Lumiea Systems Research Division — ThunderStruck Service LLC — "GEP-Based Security: Behavioral
