A below its minimum → BLOCK), the EMA baseline update with α = 0.2, the stability-bound hardening and the instruction to
track agent and operator alignment separately are the work of:

  Gary W. Floyd, Lumiea Systems Research Division — ThunderStruck Service LLC — "Bayesian Entropy Similarity (BES):
